    "type": "cexolocstring",
    "value": {
      "0": "This blade has tasted much blood in the frozen wastes, its edge remaining sharp and hungry. A biting chill clings to the leather grip, while a faint mist trails from the steel with every swing. Wounds from its bite leave a lingering frost that slowly heals the one who strikes."
